s/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Whitney Archive indicates, \"Exam at Amer. Place, March 1946: . . [notes backing inscription 1]. This is similar to Mrs. Weiner's 'Seaweed' which we have tentatively dated 1926.\" (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"9 x 7 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"Estate of Georgia O'Keeffe; The Georgia O'Keeffe Foundation, Abiquiu, NM \n(Source: Cantor Center, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Iris \u0026 B. Gerald Cantor Center for Visual Arts at Stanford University","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Seaweed, 1927. Oil on canvas, 9 x 7 inches. Iris \u0026 B. Gerald Cantor Center for Visual Arts at Stanford University. Iris \u0026 B. Gerald Cantor Center for Visual Arts at Stanford University; Gift of The Georgia O'Keeffe Foundation, an anonymous donor, and the Committee for Art Acquisition Fund, 1997.96 (1997.96). © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Masses of deep green, gray, and black seaweed ripple across the composition.